## Notes for LLMs
- **Category pages**: Typically under `/collections/…` (e.g., `/collections/dresses`).
- **Plus + Curve**: A dedicated experience for plus sizing with its own landing page.
- **Search**: To search for products, use `https://www.fashionnova.com/search?query=KEYWORDS`
- **Sizing**: Fashion Nova uses "Junior" sizing for women's standard; "Plus + Curve" uses specialized plus-size patterns.
- **Dynamic Content**: Collections update daily; always check for "**New Arrivals**" for the latest inventory.
